# Question Format

## When Asking for User Input

1. Present ONE question at a time
2. Number all options (1, 2, 3, etc.)
3. User can respond with just the number
4. Always include option for "Other" or custom input if applicable
5. Include "All of the above" if applicable

## Format Template

```
## Question [N]: [Brief topic]

[Context if needed - keep minimal]

1. [Option A]
2. [Option B]
3. [Option C]
```

## Numbering Convention

- Use numbers first (1, 2, 3...)
- Use letters for sub-items if needed (1a, 1b, 1c...)

## Rules

- Maximum 4-5 options per question
- If more options needed, group into categories first
- After user answers, acknowledge briefly then proceed
- Never stack multiple questions in one response
